1
00:00:02,509 --> 00:00:04,135
KATARA: Water...

2
00:00:04,886 --> 00:00:06,095
Earth...

3
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:08,348
Fire...

4
00:00:08,890 --> 00:00:10,308
Air.

5
00:00:11,351 --> 00:00:15,021
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,396 --> 00:00:18,608
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,484 --> 00:00:22,570
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,654 --> 00:00:23,780
could stop them.

9
00:00:23,863 --> 00:00:25,573
But when the world
needed him most,

10
00:00:25,657 --> 00:00:26,824
he vanished.

11
00:00:27,367 --> 00:00:28,409
100 years passed,

12
00:00:28,493 --> 00:00:31,120
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar―

13
00:00:31,204 --> 00:00:32,789
An airbender named Aang.

14
00:00:32,956 --> 00:00:35,083
And although his airbending
skills are great,

15
00:00:35,166 --> 00:00:37,877
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

16
00:00:37,961 --> 00:00:38,962
AANG: Oof.

17
00:00:39,045 --> 00:00:42,173
But I believe Aang can save the world.

18
00:00:50,473 --> 00:00:53,851
Even though I was born blind,
I've never had a problem seeing.

19
00:00:53,935 --> 00:00:55,645
I see with earthbending.

20
00:00:56,229 --> 00:00:57,730
Look here, sugar queen,

21
00:00:57,814 --> 00:00:59,399
I gave up everything I had

22
00:00:59,482 --> 00:01:01,609
so that I could
teach Aang earthbending.

23
00:01:07,240 --> 00:01:08,741
Well, look at this.

24
00:01:09,409 --> 00:01:12,537
Enemies and traitors
all working together.

25
00:01:14,372 --> 00:01:15,415
Aah!

26
00:01:30,597 --> 00:01:32,056
Today's the day.

27
00:01:32,140 --> 00:01:33,266
Can you believe it?

28
00:01:33,349 --> 00:01:35,518
After all that time
searching for a teacher,

29
00:01:35,602 --> 00:01:37,895
I'm finally
starting earthbending.

30
00:01:38,021 --> 00:01:39,647
And this place,
it's perfect.

31
00:01:39,772 --> 00:01:41,107
Don't you think?

32
00:01:41,482 --> 00:01:42,483
Sokka?

33
00:01:43,276 --> 00:01:44,277
( GROWLS )

34
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:45,862
Oh, you're still sleeping, huh?

35
00:01:48,531 --> 00:01:49,616
( WHISPERS ) Sorry.

36
00:01:51,951 --> 00:01:54,787
Good morning, earthbending student.

37
00:01:55,788 --> 00:01:57,332
Good morning, Sifu Toph.

38
00:01:57,540 --> 00:02:00,460
Hey, you never call me
Sifu Katara.

39
00:02:00,543 --> 00:02:02,545
Well, if you think I should.

40
00:02:02,629 --> 00:02:03,630
( SOKKA GROWLS )

41
00:02:04,255 --> 00:02:05,381
Sorry, snoozles.

42
00:02:05,506 --> 00:02:08,384
We'll do our earthbending
as quietly as we can.

43
00:02:10,136 --> 00:02:13,264
Aah!

44
00:02:14,599 --> 00:02:15,933
( GRUMBLING EXCITEDLY )

45
00:02:17,060 --> 00:02:18,895
Running around
and making noises

46
00:02:18,978 --> 00:02:21,147
and Sokka's trying to sleep.

47
00:02:22,065 --> 00:02:24,025
So what move are you gonna
teach me first?

48
00:02:24,108 --> 00:02:26,402
Rockalanche, the trembler?

49
00:02:26,611 --> 00:02:29,614
Oh, maybe I can learn to make a whirlpool
out of land.

50
00:02:29,906 --> 00:02:33,242
Well, let's start with, move a rock.

51
00:02:33,785 --> 00:02:35,286
Sounds good. Sounds good.

52
00:02:36,579 --> 00:02:39,582
The key to earthbending
is your stance.

53
00:02:39,666 --> 00:02:42,126
You've got to be
steady and strong.

54
00:02:42,210 --> 00:02:44,045
Rock is a stubborn element.

55
00:02:44,128 --> 00:02:45,505
If you're going to move it,

56
00:02:45,588 --> 00:02:47,840
you've got to be like a rock yourself.

57
00:02:47,965 --> 00:02:49,509
Like a rock. Got it.

58
00:02:49,592 --> 00:02:50,593
Good.

59
00:02:50,677 --> 00:02:53,304
Now, the actual motion of
this one is pretty simple.

60
00:02:57,809 --> 00:03:00,019
Ok, you ready to give it a try?

61
00:03:00,436 --> 00:03:01,437
I'm ready.

62
00:03:03,398 --> 00:03:05,942
Aah! Uh!

63
00:03:06,401 --> 00:03:07,735
SOKKA: Rock beats airbender.

64
00:03:12,573 --> 00:03:14,367
Ha ha! I got you, dad.

65
00:03:15,159 --> 00:03:17,495
No! Ha ha.

66
00:03:17,578 --> 00:03:18,996
( LAUGHTER )

67
00:03:23,376 --> 00:03:25,586
My beloved Lu Ten,

68
00:03:26,045 --> 00:03:27,547
I will see you again.

69
00:03:29,757 --> 00:03:30,758
ZUKO: Uncle.

70
00:03:31,467 --> 00:03:32,969
You were unconscious.

71
00:03:33,970 --> 00:03:35,138
Azula did this to you.

72
00:03:35,847 --> 00:03:37,598
It was a surprise attack.

73
00:03:37,724 --> 00:03:40,643
Somehow that's not so surprising.

74
00:03:43,604 --> 00:03:45,565
I hope I made it
the way you like it.

75
00:03:48,484 --> 00:03:49,777
( DEADPAN ) Good.

76
00:03:50,862 --> 00:03:51,863
( GAGS )

77
00:03:51,946 --> 00:03:55,742
That was very, um, bracing.

78
00:03:58,161 --> 00:04:00,163
So, uncle, I've been thinking.

79
00:04:00,246 --> 00:04:01,622
It's only a matter of time

80
00:04:01,706 --> 00:04:03,166
before I run into Azula again.

81
00:04:03,332 --> 00:04:05,752
I'm going to need to know more
advanced firebending

82
00:04:05,835 --> 00:04:07,712
if I want to stand a chance
against her.

83
00:04:07,795 --> 00:04:08,921
I know what you'll say.

84
00:04:09,005 --> 00:04:11,758
She's my sister. I should be
trying to get along with her.

85
00:04:11,841 --> 00:04:15,678
No. She's crazy,
and she needs to go down.

86
00:04:22,935 --> 00:04:25,354
It's time to resume your training.

87
00:04:25,980 --> 00:04:27,607
I don't understand
what went wrong.

88
00:04:27,690 --> 00:04:29,442
He did it exactly the way you did.

89
00:04:29,525 --> 00:04:30,777
Maybe there's another way.

90
00:04:31,235 --> 00:04:33,738
What if I came at the boulder
from a different angle?

91
00:04:33,821 --> 00:04:35,198
No, that's the problem.

92
00:04:35,281 --> 00:04:37,450
You've got to stop thinking
like an airbender.

93
00:04:37,784 --> 00:04:40,077
There's no different angle,
no clever solution,

94
00:04:40,161 --> 00:04:42,705
no trickity-trick
that's gonna move that rock.

95
00:04:42,997 --> 00:04:45,082
You've got
to face it head-on.

96
00:04:45,166 --> 00:04:48,461
And when I say head-on,
I mean like this.

97
00:04:48,795 --> 00:04:49,796
Hyah!

98
00:04:50,546 --> 00:04:51,547
Whoa.

99
00:04:54,050 --> 00:04:56,427
I've been training Aang
for a while now.

100
00:04:56,511 --> 00:04:59,597
He really responds well to a positive
teaching experience―

101
00:04:59,972 --> 00:05:01,849
Lots of encouragement
and praise,

102
00:05:02,183 --> 00:05:04,519
Kind words. If he's
doing something wrong,

103
00:05:04,602 --> 00:05:07,605
maybe a gentle nudge
in the right direction.

104
00:05:07,939 --> 00:05:11,609
Thanks, Katara.
A gentle nudge. I'll try that.

105
00:05:12,193 --> 00:05:14,487
Keep your knees high,
twinkle toes.

106
00:05:34,882 --> 00:05:35,967
Rock collide.

107
00:05:59,490 --> 00:06:00,491
Huh?

108
00:06:21,596 --> 00:06:22,805
Rock collide.

109
00:06:34,609 --> 00:06:36,110
You're awfully cute,

110
00:06:36,319 --> 00:06:39,155
But unfortunately for you,
you're made of meat.

111
00:06:40,364 --> 00:06:42,450
Just a bit closer.

112
00:06:42,533 --> 00:06:45,369
( YELLING )

113
00:06:50,207 --> 00:06:51,250
Gotcha.

114
00:06:55,046 --> 00:06:58,299
You are one lucky
little meat creature.

115
00:07:00,801 --> 00:07:04,055
Lightning is
a pure expression of firebending―

116
00:07:04,138 --> 00:07:05,514
Without aggression.

117
00:07:05,598 --> 00:07:08,059
It is not fueled by rage or emotion

118
00:07:08,142 --> 00:07:09,644
the way other firebending is.

119
00:07:10,394 --> 00:07:13,064
Some call lightning
the cold-blooded fire.

120
00:07:13,814 --> 00:07:16,734
It is precise and deadly, like Azula.

121
00:07:17,234 --> 00:07:19,236
To perform the technique requires

122
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,696
peace of mind.

123
00:07:20,905 --> 00:07:23,866
I see. That's why we're drinking tea―

124
00:07:24,659 --> 00:07:25,952
To calm the mind.

125
00:07:26,035 --> 00:07:27,620
Oh, yeah, good point!

126
00:07:28,245 --> 00:07:29,705
( SLOWLY ) I mean, yes.

127
00:07:30,581 --> 00:07:32,375
There is energy all around us.

128
00:07:32,875 --> 00:07:35,920
The energy is both Yin and Yang―

129
00:07:36,253 --> 00:07:39,173
A positive energy and a negative energy.

130
00:07:39,256 --> 00:07:42,885
Only a select few firebenders
can separate these energies.

131
00:07:43,552 --> 00:07:45,554
This creates an imbalance.

132
00:07:45,638 --> 00:07:48,349
The energy wants to restore balance.

133
00:07:48,432 --> 00:07:51,477
And in the moment
the positive and negative energy

134
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:53,479
come crashing back together,

135
00:07:53,562 --> 00:07:56,565
You provide release and guidance,

136
00:07:56,649 --> 00:07:58,234
creating lightning.

137
00:08:12,123 --> 00:08:13,290
I'm ready to try it.

138
00:08:14,792 --> 00:08:16,919
Remember, once you separate the energy,

139
00:08:17,003 --> 00:08:18,546
you do not command it.

140
00:08:18,629 --> 00:08:20,673
You are simply its humble guide.

141
00:08:21,132 --> 00:08:22,258
Breathe first.

142
00:08:22,633 --> 00:08:24,010
( INHALES )

143
00:08:30,641 --> 00:08:32,560
Hyah! Uh!

144
00:08:37,898 --> 00:08:40,985
TOPH: This time, we're going to
try something a little different.

145
00:08:41,068 --> 00:08:44,447
Instead of moving a rock,
we're going to stop a rock.

146
00:08:44,780 --> 00:08:46,323
Get in your horse stance.

147
00:08:47,992 --> 00:08:50,202
I'm going to roll that boulder
down at you.

148
00:08:50,619 --> 00:08:52,621
If you have the attitude
of an earthbender,

149
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:56,000
you'll stay in your stance
and stop the rock,

150
00:08:56,625 --> 00:08:58,085
Like this.

151
00:08:58,461 --> 00:09:00,046
Sorry, Toph, but are you sure

152
00:09:00,129 --> 00:09:02,798
this is really the best way
to teach Aang earthbending?

153
00:09:03,174 --> 00:09:04,800
I'm glad you said something.

154
00:09:05,134 --> 00:09:06,844
Actually, there is a better way.

155
00:09:07,636 --> 00:09:09,430
This way, you'll really have to sense

156
00:09:09,513 --> 00:09:11,640
the vibrations
of the boulder to stop it.

157
00:09:12,183 --> 00:09:13,434
Thank you, Katara.

158
00:09:13,517 --> 00:09:15,269
( SARCASTICALLY )
Yeah, thanks, Katara.

159
00:09:15,561 --> 00:09:16,562
( CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY )

160
00:09:44,340 --> 00:09:45,925
I guess I just panicked.

161
00:09:46,008 --> 00:09:47,343
I don't know what to say.

162
00:09:47,676 --> 00:09:50,179
There's nothing to say.
You blew it.

163
00:09:50,262 --> 00:09:53,015
You had a perfect stance
and perfect form,

164
00:09:53,099 --> 00:09:54,725
but when it came right down to it,

165
00:09:54,809 --> 00:09:56,352
you didn't have the guts.

166
00:09:57,103 --> 00:09:58,771
I know. I'm sorry.

167
00:09:59,355 --> 00:10:00,689
Yeah, you are sorry.

168
00:10:00,898 --> 00:10:02,983
If you're not tough enough
to stop the rock,

169
00:10:03,067 --> 00:10:05,820
then you can at least
give it the pleasure of smushing you

170
00:10:05,903 --> 00:10:08,656
instead ofjumping out
of the way like a jelly-boned wimp.

171
00:10:09,073 --> 00:10:13,661
Now do you have what it takes
to face that rock like an earthbender?

172
00:10:14,870 --> 00:10:17,540
No, I don't think I do.

173
00:10:17,957 --> 00:10:19,208
Aang, it's no big deal.

174
00:10:19,291 --> 00:10:22,378
You'll take a break and try
earthbending again when you're ready.

175
00:10:22,461 --> 00:10:25,339
Besides, you still have
a lot of waterbending to work on, ok?

176
00:10:25,881 --> 00:10:27,842
Yeah, that sounds good.

177
00:10:29,426 --> 00:10:32,555
Yeah, whatever.
Go splash around until you feel better.

178
00:10:37,309 --> 00:10:38,602
Why can't I do it?

179
00:10:38,686 --> 00:10:41,147
Instead of lightning,
it keeps exploding in my face,

180
00:10:41,397 --> 00:10:43,023
like everything always does.

181
00:10:43,941 --> 00:10:45,734
I was afraid this might happen.

182
00:10:46,277 --> 00:10:48,529
You will not be able
to master lightning

183
00:10:48,612 --> 00:10:51,490
until you have dealt
with the turmoil inside you.

184
00:10:51,991 --> 00:10:53,117
What turmoil?

185
00:10:53,367 --> 00:10:56,579
Zuko, you must let go
of your feelings of shame

186
00:10:56,662 --> 00:10:58,747
if you want your anger to go away.

187
00:10:59,039 --> 00:11:00,749
But I don't feel any shame at all.

188
00:11:00,833 --> 00:11:02,001
I'm as proud as ever.

189
00:11:02,334 --> 00:11:05,546
Prince Zuko, pride is not
the opposite of shame,

190
00:11:05,629 --> 00:11:06,630
but its source.

191
00:11:07,006 --> 00:11:10,176
True humility is the only antidote
to shame.

192
00:11:10,259 --> 00:11:14,013
Well, my life has been nothing
but humbling lately.

193
00:11:15,431 --> 00:11:17,308
I have another idea.

194
00:11:17,641 --> 00:11:19,643
I will teach you
a firebending move

195
00:11:19,727 --> 00:11:21,437
that even Azula doesn't know,

196
00:11:21,687 --> 00:11:23,939
because I made it up myself.

197
00:11:28,611 --> 00:11:30,738
You probably think
I deserve this, don't you?

198
00:11:33,532 --> 00:11:34,950
Look, I'm sorry I hunted you,

199
00:11:35,034 --> 00:11:37,119
but that's just the natural
order of things.

200
00:11:37,203 --> 00:11:40,122
Big things eat smaller things.
Nothing personal.

201
00:11:40,206 --> 00:11:42,208
But this time,
it didn't work out that way.

202
00:11:42,541 --> 00:11:43,584
( CALLS )

203
00:11:44,210 --> 00:11:46,921
I admit it, you're cute.

204
00:11:48,923 --> 00:11:50,633
Ok, you convinced me.

205
00:11:51,050 --> 00:11:52,343
If I get out of this alive,

206
00:11:52,426 --> 00:11:55,512
it's a karmically correct
vegetarian existence for me.

207
00:11:55,721 --> 00:12:00,351
No meat, even though meat
is so tasty.

208
00:12:11,195 --> 00:12:13,906
Hey, it looks like my karma's
already paying off.

209
00:12:15,407 --> 00:12:16,825
That's ok. I got it.

210
00:12:21,455 --> 00:12:22,915
Now come back, boomerang.

211
00:12:25,626 --> 00:12:26,627
( CROAKING )

212
00:12:31,840 --> 00:12:34,760
You know this block you're having
is only temporary, right?

213
00:12:35,094 --> 00:12:36,553
I don't want to talk about it.

214
00:12:36,804 --> 00:12:39,139
You do realize
that's the problem, don't you?

215
00:12:39,556 --> 00:12:41,809
If you face this issue
instead of avoiding it...

216
00:12:41,892 --> 00:12:43,477
I know, I know, I know, I know.

217
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:46,647
I get it, all right?
I need to face it head-on like a rock.

218
00:12:46,939 --> 00:12:48,440
But I just can't do it.

219
00:12:48,524 --> 00:12:50,359
I don't know why I can't, but I can't.

220
00:12:50,818 --> 00:12:53,195
Aang, if fire and water are opposites,

221
00:12:53,279 --> 00:12:55,072
Then what's the opposite of air?

222
00:12:55,322 --> 00:12:56,448
I guess it's earth.

223
00:12:56,699 --> 00:12:58,784
That's why it's so hard
for you to get this.

224
00:12:59,285 --> 00:13:01,287
You're working
with your natural opposite.

225
00:13:01,370 --> 00:13:02,579
But you'll figure it out.

226
00:13:02,663 --> 00:13:03,872
I know you will.

227
00:13:06,667 --> 00:13:07,668
Think fast.

228
00:13:10,629 --> 00:13:14,717
Excellent. You have the reflexes
of a waterbending master.

229
00:13:14,842 --> 00:13:18,512
Thanks, Katara, Sifu Katara.

230
00:13:22,516 --> 00:13:24,685
Fire is the element of power.

231
00:13:24,768 --> 00:13:27,688
The people of the Fire Nation
have desire and will

232
00:13:27,980 --> 00:13:30,399
and the energy and drive
to achieve what they want.

233
00:13:32,151 --> 00:13:34,778
Earth is the element of substance.

234
00:13:34,862 --> 00:13:36,572
The people of the Earth Kingdom

235
00:13:36,655 --> 00:13:38,240
are diverse and strong.

236
00:13:38,615 --> 00:13:40,909
They are persistent and enduring.

237
00:13:42,119 --> 00:13:44,496
Air is the element of freedom.

238
00:13:44,580 --> 00:13:47,249
The Air Nomads detached themselves

239
00:13:47,333 --> 00:13:49,335
from worldly concerns

240
00:13:49,626 --> 00:13:51,545
and found peace and freedom.

241
00:13:51,837 --> 00:13:53,547
Also, they apparently had

242
00:13:53,630 --> 00:13:55,924
pretty good senses of humor.

243
00:13:59,428 --> 00:14:02,181
Water is the element of change.

244
00:14:02,264 --> 00:14:04,058
The people of the Water Tribe

245
00:14:04,141 --> 00:14:07,227
are capable of adapting to many things.

246
00:14:07,644 --> 00:14:11,148
They have a deep sense
of community and love

247
00:14:11,357 --> 00:14:13,525
that holds them together
through anything.

248
00:14:14,860 --> 00:14:16,737
Why are you telling me these things?

249
00:14:17,321 --> 00:14:20,783
It is important to draw wisdom
from many different places.

250
00:14:21,116 --> 00:14:23,660
If we take it from only one place,

251
00:14:23,744 --> 00:14:26,121
it becomes rigid and stale.

252
00:14:26,205 --> 00:14:28,916
Understanding others―
The other elements

253
00:14:29,249 --> 00:14:30,959
and the other nations―

254
00:14:31,043 --> 00:14:32,920
will help you become whole.

255
00:14:33,670 --> 00:14:37,091
All this four elements talk
is sounding like Avatar stuff.

256
00:14:37,424 --> 00:14:40,677
It is the combination
of the four elements in one person

257
00:14:40,761 --> 00:14:43,305
that makes the Avatar so powerful,

258
00:14:43,639 --> 00:14:46,350
but it can make you more powerful, too.

259
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:49,019
You see, the technique
I am about to teach you

260
00:14:49,103 --> 00:14:51,688
is one I learned
by studying the waterbenders.

261
00:15:00,864 --> 00:15:01,949
Aang...

262
00:15:02,032 --> 00:15:03,534
I found these nuts in your bag.

263
00:15:03,617 --> 00:15:05,160
I figured you wouldn't mind.

264
00:15:05,244 --> 00:15:07,037
And besides, even if you did,

265
00:15:07,121 --> 00:15:09,748
you're too much of a pushover
to do anything about it.

266
00:15:10,207 --> 00:15:12,334
As a matter of fact,
I don't mind.

267
00:15:12,418 --> 00:15:14,044
I'm happy to share
anything I have.

268
00:15:14,586 --> 00:15:16,922
You know, I'm really
glad you feel that way,

269
00:15:17,005 --> 00:15:20,134
Because I also have
this great new nutcracker.

270
00:15:23,679 --> 00:15:25,848
- Actually, I'd prefer if you didn't―
-( SMASH )

271
00:15:26,181 --> 00:15:28,350
That's an antique,
handcrafted by the monk―

272
00:15:29,143 --> 00:15:30,561
It's a delicate instrument.

273
00:15:30,978 --> 00:15:33,605
It's not the only
delicate instrument around here.

274
00:15:39,194 --> 00:15:41,572
Om.

275
00:15:41,989 --> 00:15:43,323
Hey, Aang, have you seen―

276
00:15:43,407 --> 00:15:44,450
Meditating here.

277
00:15:44,741 --> 00:15:46,493
It's important. It's almost sundown,

278
00:15:46,577 --> 00:15:48,328
and Sokka isn't back yet.

279
00:15:48,412 --> 00:15:49,997
I think we should search for him.

280
00:15:50,247 --> 00:15:52,249
We'll find him faster if we split up.

281
00:15:54,585 --> 00:15:56,670
Ok, karma person or thing,

282
00:15:56,753 --> 00:15:58,422
whoever's in charge of this stuff,

283
00:15:58,505 --> 00:16:01,091
if I can just
get out of this situation alive,

284
00:16:01,175 --> 00:16:05,429
I will give up meat and sarcasm, ok?

285
00:16:05,512 --> 00:16:08,223
Ow! That's all I got.

286
00:16:08,557 --> 00:16:10,434
That's pretty much my whole identity.

287
00:16:10,517 --> 00:16:13,061
Sokka, the meat and sarcasm guy.

288
00:16:13,145 --> 00:16:14,730
But I'm willing to be Sokka,

289
00:16:14,813 --> 00:16:16,607
the veggies and straight-talk fellow.

290
00:16:16,857 --> 00:16:17,858
Deal?

291
00:16:18,734 --> 00:16:19,735
Aang!

292
00:16:19,818 --> 00:16:21,820
Thank goodness.
Have you got any meat?

293
00:16:22,321 --> 00:16:24,198
Sokka, are you ok?

294
00:16:25,491 --> 00:16:28,285
Stop, stop!
You're gonna pull my fingers off.

295
00:16:28,368 --> 00:16:30,454
And I don't think
the rest of me is coming.

296
00:16:30,746 --> 00:16:33,874
Hmm, I bet I can airbend
you out of here.

297
00:16:40,464 --> 00:16:42,424
Seriously, Aang, I know you're new at it,

298
00:16:42,508 --> 00:16:45,177
but I could use a little
earthbending here. How about it?

299
00:16:46,512 --> 00:16:47,513
I can't.

300
00:16:47,596 --> 00:16:48,722
I can't do it.

301
00:16:55,854 --> 00:16:58,607
Well, if you can't earthbend me
out of here, go get Toph.

302
00:16:58,732 --> 00:16:59,983
I can't do that either.

303
00:17:00,400 --> 00:17:02,027
You can't? Why not?

304
00:17:02,444 --> 00:17:05,906
It would just be really... Uncomfortable.

305
00:17:06,114 --> 00:17:07,115
"Uncomfortable."

306
00:17:07,199 --> 00:17:09,535
Well, I wouldn't want you
to feel uncomfortable.

307
00:17:09,618 --> 00:17:10,786
Thanks, Sokka.

308
00:17:11,245 --> 00:17:14,289
This whole earthbending thing
really has me confused.

309
00:17:14,373 --> 00:17:15,999
There's so much pressure.

310
00:17:16,333 --> 00:17:18,335
Everyone expects me
to get it right away.

311
00:17:18,460 --> 00:17:21,046
It puts me in a really awkward position.

312
00:17:21,171 --> 00:17:23,382
Awkward position?
I think I know the feeling.

313
00:17:23,507 --> 00:17:25,384
If I try, I fail.

314
00:17:25,467 --> 00:17:28,595
But if I don't try,
I'm never gonna get it.

315
00:17:28,679 --> 00:17:31,265
I feel like I'm caught between
a rock and a hard place.

316
00:17:31,390 --> 00:17:33,058
Hmm, how about that?

317
00:17:33,767 --> 00:17:35,936
Aang, this is my friend,
Fufu Cuddly Poops.

318
00:17:36,019 --> 00:17:37,854
Fufu Cuddly Poops, Aang.

319
00:17:37,938 --> 00:17:41,525
Aw. What a cute name for a little baby
sabertooth moose lion cub.

320
00:17:41,984 --> 00:17:44,820
Really? He looks nothing like
a sabertooth moose lion.

321
00:17:44,903 --> 00:17:47,823
It's hard to tell before
their giant teeth and horns grow in.

322
00:17:48,073 --> 00:17:49,825
What you doing out here, little guy?

323
00:17:49,950 --> 00:17:51,118
Did you lose your mama?

324
00:17:52,494 --> 00:17:53,579
( ANIMAL GROWLING )

325
00:17:59,876 --> 00:18:02,504
Waterbenders deal
with the flow of energy.

326
00:18:03,130 --> 00:18:06,425
A waterbender lets their defense
become their offense,

327
00:18:06,508 --> 00:18:09,553
turning their opponent's
energy against them.

328
00:18:09,636 --> 00:18:12,139
I learned a way to do this with lightning.

329
00:18:12,222 --> 00:18:14,224
You can teach me to redirect lightning?

330
00:18:15,309 --> 00:18:18,353
If you let the energy
in your own body flow,

331
00:18:18,478 --> 00:18:20,105
The lightning will follow it.

332
00:18:20,188 --> 00:18:22,983
You must create a pathway
from your fingertips

333
00:18:23,066 --> 00:18:25,652
up your arm to your shoulder,

334
00:18:25,736 --> 00:18:27,738
then down into your stomach.

335
00:18:28,238 --> 00:18:31,074
The stomach is the source
of energy in your body.

336
00:18:31,533 --> 00:18:33,785
It is called the sea of chi,

337
00:18:34,745 --> 00:18:38,081
only in my case,
it is more like a vast ocean.

338
00:18:38,165 --> 00:18:39,958
( LAUGHING )

339
00:18:41,668 --> 00:18:46,715
From the stomach, you direct it
up again and out the other arm.

340
00:18:46,798 --> 00:18:48,800
The stomach detour is critical.

341
00:18:49,301 --> 00:18:52,721
You must not let the lightning
pass through your heart,

342
00:18:52,804 --> 00:18:54,973
for the damage could be deadly.

343
00:18:55,766 --> 00:18:58,852
You may wish to try
a physical motion

344
00:18:58,935 --> 00:19:03,023
to get a feel for the pathway's flow,
like this.

345
00:19:07,277 --> 00:19:09,905
Now, are you focusing your energy?

346
00:19:10,238 --> 00:19:13,450
Can you feel your own chi flowing in,

347
00:19:13,533 --> 00:19:16,495
down, up, and out?

348
00:19:16,578 --> 00:19:17,871
I think so.

349
00:19:19,581 --> 00:19:23,585
Come on. You got to feel the flow.

350
00:19:29,299 --> 00:19:31,510
Excellent. You've got it.

351
00:19:31,760 --> 00:19:34,096
Great. I'm ready
to try it with real lightning.

352
00:19:34,805 --> 00:19:38,475
What? Are you crazy?
Lightning is very dangerous.

353
00:19:38,558 --> 00:19:40,018
I thought that was the point―

354
00:19:40,102 --> 00:19:42,270
You teaching me how
to protect myself from it.

355
00:19:42,354 --> 00:19:45,440
Yeah, but I'm not going to shoot
lightning at you.

356
00:19:45,816 --> 00:19:46,817
If you're lucky,

357
00:19:46,900 --> 00:19:50,153
you will never have to use this
technique at all.

358
00:19:52,197 --> 00:19:54,157
( THUNDER )

359
00:19:54,241 --> 00:19:56,910
Well, if you won't help me,
I'll find my own lightning.

360
00:19:58,745 --> 00:19:59,788
( CALLING )

361
00:20:01,331 --> 00:20:02,416
Hey there.

362
00:20:02,999 --> 00:20:04,251
We found your cub.

363
00:20:10,966 --> 00:20:13,009
See? We have no problem with you.

364
00:20:13,552 --> 00:20:14,594
We're friendly.

365
00:20:14,678 --> 00:20:15,804
( SNORTING )

366
00:20:16,346 --> 00:20:18,640
Aang, this is bad.
You got to get me out of here.

367
00:20:19,558 --> 00:20:20,559
Aah!

368
00:20:30,819 --> 00:20:32,028
This is really bad.

369
00:20:32,237 --> 00:20:34,531
Please, Aang!
You have to earthbend me out.

370
00:20:34,614 --> 00:20:35,991
There's no other way.

371
00:20:37,075 --> 00:20:40,829
Hyah! Hyah!

372
00:20:44,583 --> 00:20:45,584
Oh, no.

373
00:20:47,461 --> 00:20:49,212
Yoo-hoo! Look at me!

374
00:20:58,472 --> 00:21:00,015
Please. Don't leave me again.

375
00:21:00,098 --> 00:21:01,099
I won't.

376
00:21:19,117 --> 00:21:20,327
What are you doing here?

377
00:21:20,660 --> 00:21:21,995
Just enjoying the show.

378
00:21:22,078 --> 00:21:24,498
What? You were there the whole time?

379
00:21:24,581 --> 00:21:25,832
Pretty much.

380
00:21:25,916 --> 00:21:27,292
Why didn't you do something?

381
00:21:27,584 --> 00:21:28,794
Sokka was in trouble.

382
00:21:28,877 --> 00:21:30,128
I was in trouble!

383
00:21:30,212 --> 00:21:32,714
You could have gotten him out
and helped us get away.

384
00:21:32,798 --> 00:21:34,466
I guess it just didn't occur to me.

385
00:21:39,763 --> 00:21:42,599
Enough. I want my staff back.

386
00:21:43,725 --> 00:21:44,726
Do it now.

387
00:21:44,893 --> 00:21:45,894
What?

388
00:21:45,977 --> 00:21:47,437
Earthbend, twinkle toes.

389
00:21:47,687 --> 00:21:50,607
You just stood your ground
against a crazy beast.

390
00:21:50,690 --> 00:21:51,942
And even more impressive,

391
00:21:52,025 --> 00:21:53,819
you stood your ground against me.

392
00:21:53,902 --> 00:21:55,320
You've got the stuff.

393
00:21:55,612 --> 00:21:57,280
- But―
- Do it!

394
00:21:58,740 --> 00:21:59,825
Hyah!

395
00:22:00,659 --> 00:22:01,785
You did it!

396
00:22:02,369 --> 00:22:04,120
You're an earthbender.

397
00:22:04,204 --> 00:22:05,497
I can't believe it.

398
00:22:05,580 --> 00:22:08,959
Aw. This is really a wonderful,
touching moment.

399
00:22:09,167 --> 00:22:10,669
So could you get me out of here

400
00:22:10,752 --> 00:22:13,129
so I can give you both a big snuggly hug?

401
00:22:13,547 --> 00:22:14,798
No problem, Sokka.

402
00:22:15,173 --> 00:22:17,676
Actually, you should probably
let me do that.

403
00:22:17,759 --> 00:22:19,511
You're still a little new to this.

404
00:22:19,803 --> 00:22:21,388
You might accidentally crush him.

405
00:22:21,638 --> 00:22:23,056
Yeah, no crushing, please.

406
00:22:30,856 --> 00:22:32,315
You found him!

407
00:22:33,024 --> 00:22:34,943
The whole time I was in that hole,

408
00:22:35,026 --> 00:22:37,612
not knowing if I would live or die,

409
00:22:37,696 --> 00:22:40,407
it makes a man think
about what's really important.

410
00:22:40,490 --> 00:22:41,658
I realized―

411
00:22:41,741 --> 00:22:43,410
Hey, Katara, look what I can do.

412
00:22:46,830 --> 00:22:48,748
You did it!
I knew you would.

413
00:22:49,249 --> 00:22:51,543
You tried the positive reinforcement,
didn't you?

414
00:22:52,085 --> 00:22:54,379
Yup. It worked wonders.

415
00:22:54,754 --> 00:22:56,131
( GROWLS )

416
00:22:56,214 --> 00:22:59,009
Appa, Appa, I can earthbend now.

417
00:22:59,092 --> 00:23:00,886
The key is being
completely rooted―

418
00:23:01,177 --> 00:23:03,263
Physically and mentally unmovable.

419
00:23:03,513 --> 00:23:05,390
Whoa! Uh!

420
00:23:05,974 --> 00:23:07,350
( LAUGHTER )

421
00:23:09,978 --> 00:23:10,979
( THUNDER )

422
00:23:13,607 --> 00:23:15,859
You've always
thrown everything you could at me.

423
00:23:15,942 --> 00:23:19,070
Well, I can take it.
And now I can give it back!

424
00:23:23,491 --> 00:23:24,492
Come on!

425
00:23:25,035 --> 00:23:26,036
Strike me!

426
00:23:26,119 --> 00:23:28,163
You've never held back before.

427
00:23:35,670 --> 00:23:38,798
( ZUKO YELLS )
